WEBVTT

00:00:09.074 --> 00:00:10.993
CRASH: It's a beautiful day
out here on the ice
今天是打冰球的好日子…

00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:12.536
as father meets daughter
父女将决出谁是冰球霸主

00:00:12.619 --> 00:00:14.538
in a quest for hockey supremacy.
父女将决出谁是冰球霸主

00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:15.956
It's Peaches meets Manny.
桃子对战曼尼

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.291
Mammoth meets mammoth.
是猛犸象对战猛犸象

00:00:17.374 --> 00:00:19.376
-Mano a mano.
-Meema me moo-ma.
人对人

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:20.753
Mama may mee-mee.
麻麻对咪咪

00:00:20.836 --> 00:00:22.254
Will you two quit it?
你们俩能闭嘴吗？

00:00:22.713 --> 00:00:24.798
-M-okay.
-Meanie.
好

00:00:24.882 --> 00:00:26.884
The blazing mammoth
takes it on the breakaway.
耀眼的猛犸象突破对方防线

00:00:26.967 --> 00:00:29.803
There's never been a player
so tough, so graceful.
从没有球员如此彪悍，又如此有风度

00:00:29.887 --> 00:00:31.597
So desperate to score.
还很渴望得分

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.932
He fakes right. He fakes left.
向右的假动作，之后是向左的

00:00:34.016 --> 00:00:35.934
He fakes knowing how to play.
还假装知道怎么打球

00:00:36.352 --> 00:00:37.353
(both grunt)

00:00:37.811 --> 00:00:38.937
-Huh?
-What's wrong?
怎么了？

00:00:39.021 --> 00:00:40.689
Lose something?
丢东西了？

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:43.359
BOTH (cheering): Hey, what's that stink
I smell out there? It's Manny!
怎么这么臭？是曼尼！

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:45.444
Hey, hey. It's Manny!
是曼尼！

00:00:45.527 --> 00:00:46.612
Whoo! You stink!
臭死了！

00:00:46.695 --> 00:00:49.406
Okay, Fuzzball. Let's see what you got.
好吧，毛球，亮出你的本事吧

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:50.991
You asked for it.
你自找的

00:00:55.162 --> 00:00:56.497
(laughs)

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:57.956
(gasps)

00:00:58.499 --> 00:01:01.710
Yes! She dominates! Again.
好啊！她又赢了！

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:03.879
Oh, please. I went easy on you.
哦，拜托，我还没动真格的呢

00:01:03.962 --> 00:01:05.381
It's called good parenting.
这就是好的父母

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:07.883
Yeah, right. Face it.
对，没错，面对事实吧

00:01:07.966 --> 00:01:09.385
I rule the ice now.
冰上的霸主是我

00:01:09.468 --> 00:01:11.720
Oh, you talk a big game, hotshot.
夸夸其谈，运动健将

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:13.555
All right, how about best of three?
三局两胜怎么样？

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:16.016
Whoo-hoo! Yes! Touchdown!
漂亮！触地得分！

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.977
Wait, no, that's not right.
Not touchdown. What is it?
等等，不对
不是触地得分，叫什么来着？

00:01:19.061 --> 00:01:21.397
Uh, hole-in-one! Whoo! (laughing)
一杆入洞！

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.439
-Julian!
-Whoa!
–朱利安！
–抱歉

00:01:22.523 --> 00:01:23.565
-Ow!
-Sorry.
–朱利安！
–抱歉

00:01:23.649 --> 00:01:25.484
Honey, I scored! Did you see me?
亲爱的，我进球了！你看到没？

00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:28.862
Yeah! And you were amazing. Whoa! Whoa!
耶！你可棒了

00:01:29.363 --> 00:01:30.489
Careful!
小心点儿！

00:01:30.572 --> 00:01:31.740
Oh, the ice is really icy.
冰上可真冰

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:34.910
It's like super-sized, extra value icy.
真是块超大号、超值的冰

00:01:34.993 --> 00:01:36.995
But I'm getting better, right?
不过我越来越好了，对吗？

00:01:37.079 --> 00:01:38.372
(Peaches laughing)
不过我越来越好了，对吗？

00:01:38.455 --> 00:01:39.623
-JULIAN: Whoa!
-(sighs)

00:01:39.706 --> 00:01:41.250
(both laughing)

00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:45.337
Okay, we'll play... later.
好吧，我们以后…再比

00:01:45.421 --> 00:01:47.881
So, she whupped your butt again, huh?
她又大获全胜了，嗯？

00:01:47.965 --> 00:01:49.925
And with a butt that size,
你屁股那么大，肯定输惨了

00:01:50.008 --> 00:01:51.760
that's a whole lot of whuppin'.
你屁股那么大，肯定输惨了

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:54.388
Nobody was whupped.
There was no whupping.
根本没有输赢

00:01:54.471 --> 00:01:55.722
It's just a loving father
只是有爱心的父亲
有计划的哄他的独生女而已

00:01:55.806 --> 00:01:57.891
sharing some strategy
with his only daughter.
只是有爱心的父亲
有计划的哄他的独生女而已

00:01:57.975 --> 00:02:00.477
Didn't know sucking was a strategy.
我都不知道玩得烂原来是计划好的呢

00:02:01.019 --> 00:02:02.479
CRASH: Okay, it's our turn.
好了，轮到我们了

00:02:02.563 --> 00:02:04.314
Let's show them how it's done!
让我们告诉他们应该怎么玩！

00:02:04.398 --> 00:02:05.399
(both laugh)
让我们告诉他们应该怎么玩！

00:02:05.482 --> 00:02:07.234
(both grunting)

00:02:07.317 --> 00:02:08.652
You're going down, eh?
你死定了，嗯？

00:02:09.319 --> 00:02:10.362
(groaning)

00:02:10.446 --> 00:02:12.448
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! (laughs)

00:02:13.031 --> 00:02:14.199
Ta-ta-da-da!

00:02:14.283 --> 00:02:16.660
For you, my mom-in-law-to-be.
这是给你的，我未来的岳母！

00:02:16.743 --> 00:02:17.870
Buttercups!
金凤花！

00:02:17.953 --> 00:02:19.496
Nature's sunshine.
它是自然的阳光！

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:22.082
Isn't sunshine nature's sunshine?
阳光不就是自然的吗？

00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:24.501
-(groans)
-Aw! Thank you, Julian.
谢谢你，朱利安

00:02:24.585 --> 00:02:27.588
It's been so long since
anyone's given me flowers.
好久没收到过花了

00:02:27.671 --> 00:02:29.631
But you're marrying our daughter.
可你要娶我们女儿

00:02:29.715 --> 00:02:31.592
You don't have to
keep bringing us presents.
不用老给我们送礼物

00:02:31.675 --> 00:02:33.177
But it makes me happy.
不过我很开心

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:37.723
And for you, my guru,
my rock, my main mammoth...
而你呢，我的老师
我的支柱、我重要的朋友…

00:02:37.806 --> 00:02:40.934
To you, I give the greatest gift of all.
我要把最好的礼物送给你

00:02:41.018 --> 00:02:43.270
Wait. What are you doing?
等等，你要干吗？

00:02:43.353 --> 00:02:46.106
Come on, Bro-Dad. Bring it in.
来吧，岳父兄弟，收下吧

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.441
(Manny sighs)

00:02:47.774 --> 00:02:49.276
JULIAN: Oh!

00:02:49.359 --> 00:02:51.236
I can feel your heart beating.
我能感受到你的心跳

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.822
Okay. That's enough of that.
好吧，够了

00:02:54.323 --> 00:02:55.782
You better get used to it.
习惯一下吧，他们以后会和我们做邻居

00:02:55.866 --> 00:02:57.326
They'll be living right next door.
习惯一下吧，他们以后会和我们做邻居

00:02:57.659 --> 00:02:59.119
Come on, Julian. Wanna go?
走，朱利安，去走走？

00:02:59.203 --> 00:03:03.123
Actually, weren't you gonna
help me with the thing?
其实，你不是要帮我做那件事吗？

00:03:03.207 --> 00:03:05.751
Oh! Right. The thing.
哦！对，那件事

00:03:05.834 --> 00:03:07.002
Gotta do the thing.
得去做那件事

00:03:07.085 --> 00:03:08.378
I can do the thing.
我可以帮忙

00:03:08.462 --> 00:03:09.463
BOTH: No!
不用！

00:03:10.339 --> 00:03:12.132
It's a girl thing.
那是女孩的事

00:03:12.716 --> 00:03:15.511
Hey! Why don't you go do a guy thing?
嘿！你去做点男人的事吧？

00:03:15.594 --> 00:03:16.637
You know, you don't spend
你都没怎么陪过你的朋友

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:17.846
nearly enough time with your friends.
你都没怎么陪过你的朋友

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.015
-I don't?
-I'll see you later.
–没有吗？
–回头见

00:03:20.098 --> 00:03:23.393
(giggles) On this special day.
在今天这个特别的日子

00:03:23.477 --> 00:03:24.811
Uh... Okay.
好吧

00:03:25.479 --> 00:03:27.272
So have you told them
about our decision yet?
你还没把咱们的决定告诉他们？

00:03:27.356 --> 00:03:29.816
No. I'm waiting for the right time.
没有，我在等合适的机会

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:32.069
Come on, Romeo. Walk with me.
过来，罗密欧，跟我走

00:03:32.152 --> 00:03:34.488
I'm gonna watch some butterflies
come out of their cocoons.
我要去看蝴蝶破茧而出

00:03:34.571 --> 00:03:36.490
-Whoa! Really?
-No.
–真的？
–假的

00:03:36.573 --> 00:03:38.075
Goodbye, sweetie.
拜拜，宝贝

00:03:38.158 --> 00:03:39.451
(blowing kisses)
拜拜，宝贝

00:03:39.535 --> 00:03:42.704
Aw! I remember when Manny
and I used to be like that.
我和曼尼以前也是那样

00:03:42.788 --> 00:03:44.998
Not me! Love them and leave them,
我不是！
爱他们，离开他们，再拿走一半财产

00:03:45.082 --> 00:03:46.500
and take half of everything.
我不是！
爱他们，离开他们，再拿走一半财产

00:03:46.583 --> 00:03:47.876
That's my motto.
这是我的座右铭

00:03:50.128 --> 00:03:51.171
(sighs)

00:03:51.255 --> 00:03:55.050
Mi amor, so many ladies
have tried and failed
亲爱的，有很多女士都尝试过

00:03:55.133 --> 00:03:58.595
to strap a saddle on Sid the stallion.
要霸占种马希德，她们都失败了

00:03:58.679 --> 00:04:00.055
(mimics horse neighing)

00:04:00.138 --> 00:04:02.849
But I want to share everything with you.
可我想和你分享所有东西

00:04:02.933 --> 00:04:05.185
You're the wind beneath my fleas,
你是让我的跳骚高飞的风，我眼中的海藻

00:04:05.269 --> 00:04:06.728
the algae of my eye.
你是让我的跳骚高飞的风，我眼中的海藻

00:04:07.354 --> 00:04:10.732
Will you be my mate for life?
你愿意成为我人生的伴侣吗？

00:04:11.775 --> 00:04:14.027
(kissing)

00:04:14.945 --> 00:04:16.488
-FRANCINE: Sidney?
-Mmm?
希德？

00:04:16.572 --> 00:04:17.906
Sidney, where are you?
希德，你在哪？

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:20.075
(grunting)

00:04:20.158 --> 00:04:21.159
Francine.
弗朗辛

00:04:23.245 --> 00:04:24.246
I need to ask...
我要问…

00:04:25.372 --> 00:04:26.707
Ow!

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:28.709
I need to ask you something.
问你点儿事

00:04:28.792 --> 00:04:29.793
Will you marry...
–你愿意嫁…
–希德，你快别说了

00:04:29.876 --> 00:04:31.378
Sid, I'm gonna stop you right there.
–你愿意嫁…
–希德，你快别说了

00:04:31.461 --> 00:04:32.754
I'm breaking up with you.
我要跟你分手

00:04:32.838 --> 00:04:35.215
What? But I planned our whole future!
什么？可我把未来都计划好了！

00:04:35.299 --> 00:04:36.758
Our wedding.
我们的婚礼

00:04:36.842 --> 00:04:37.843
Our kids.
孩子

00:04:37.926 --> 00:04:38.927
(in high-pitched voice) Mommy.
妈妈

00:04:39.011 --> 00:04:40.304
Our burial plots.
墓地

00:04:40.387 --> 00:04:41.388
How you doing?
你好啊？

00:04:41.471 --> 00:04:42.973
SID: I even hired a band.
乐队都请好了

00:04:43.056 --> 00:04:44.433
-Hey!
-(mariachi music playing)

00:04:44.516 --> 00:04:45.851
No, no. Not yet!
停、停，没到时候呢！

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:49.021
Are you crazy? We've only had one date.
你脑袋进水了？我们才约会过一次

00:04:49.104 --> 00:04:50.606
It lasted 14 minutes!
就14分钟！

00:04:50.689 --> 00:04:53.275
Yes, but it felt like 20.
对，可感觉上像20分钟

00:04:53.358 --> 00:04:54.401
Ugh!

00:04:54.484 --> 00:04:55.777
I can't! A ring?
我不干！戒指？
我喜欢戒指，但嫁你没戏

00:04:55.861 --> 00:04:57.070
I mean, I like the ring, but no.
我不干！戒指？
我喜欢戒指，但嫁你没戏

00:04:57.154 --> 00:04:58.697
I can't. You're too clingy.
不行，你太黏人了

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.283
How is this clingy? (grunts)
这很黏人吗？

00:05:01.366 --> 00:05:02.576
And by the way,
而且，你长得跟你的头像差远了

00:05:02.659 --> 00:05:04.870
you look nothing like your profile picture.
而且，你长得跟你的头像差远了

00:05:05.203 --> 00:05:07.956
Francine, you gotta start dating
outside of your species.
弗朗辛
你得开始跟其他种类的动物约会了

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:12.210
Franny, we can work this out.
Is this about the bikini? Ow!
弗朗妮，这是可以解决的
是因为比基尼吗？

00:05:13.587 --> 00:05:15.631
I didn't know it was poison ivy.
我不知道这是有毒的常春藤做的

00:05:16.006 --> 00:05:17.007
(sobbing)

00:05:17.883 --> 00:05:18.884
(blowing nose)

00:05:19.926 --> 00:05:21.928
Oh! Uh-oh.

00:05:22.012 --> 00:05:24.598
Franny. Franny, help!
弗朗妮、弗朗妮，救命！

00:05:24.681 --> 00:05:26.141
-(both scream)
-Somebody.
来人啊

00:05:26.224 --> 00:05:28.226
Is it the eyes that hurt
疼的是我的双眸…

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:29.728
or my soul?
还是我的灵魂？

00:05:29.811 --> 00:05:30.854
Ow!

00:05:30.937 --> 00:05:32.939
Definitely the eyes.
当然是眼睛疼

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.985
(chittering)

00:05:39.321 --> 00:05:40.530
Ah, women!
哎，女人哪！

00:05:40.614 --> 00:05:41.948
Yeah, women.
是啊，女人哪

00:05:42.574 --> 00:05:43.700
What about them?
她们怎么了？

00:05:43.784 --> 00:05:45.494
I don't get 'em. (whistles)
我不明白她们

00:05:46.161 --> 00:05:48.955
Like, Ellie. Life's great with her.
比如说埃丽吧，有她在的人生很好

00:05:49.039 --> 00:05:51.833
There's no surprises. Nothing ever changes.
生活没有惊喜，日子一成不变

00:05:51.917 --> 00:05:54.503
But then today, she giggled.
可今天，她自己傻笑起来

00:05:54.586 --> 00:05:56.171
Does Shira ever just giggle?
希拉会傻笑吗？

00:05:57.047 --> 00:05:58.799
Please don't eat me!
别吃我！

00:05:58.882 --> 00:05:59.966
(roars)
别吃我！

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:02.177
Uh... Shira's not a big giggler.
希拉不喜欢傻笑

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:03.887
Well, Ellie giggled.
好吧，埃丽傻笑来着

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.430
And then she wiggled.
然后会扭动着

00:06:05.514 --> 00:06:07.391
"Tee hee hee hee." Boom!
“嘻嘻嘻嘻”，咣！

00:06:07.474 --> 00:06:08.975
Don't ever do that again.
你可别再学这个了

00:06:09.059 --> 00:06:11.311
I have no idea why she's acting so weird.
我不知道她干吗奇奇怪怪的

00:06:11.395 --> 00:06:12.896
(sighs) Women.
女人哪

00:06:12.979 --> 00:06:14.815
-Women.
-Women.
女人哪

00:06:15.899 --> 00:06:17.150
SID: Hello?
有人吗？

00:06:17.234 --> 00:06:19.236
And speaking of weird.
说怪人，怪人到

00:06:19.611 --> 00:06:21.446
Anybody there? Oh!
有人吗？

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:23.782
Marco? Polo?
马可？波罗？

00:06:26.076 --> 00:06:27.077
Oh, hi, Manny.
嗨，曼尼

00:06:27.953 --> 00:06:29.454
Ew! Your breath is awful.
你口气真重

00:06:29.538 --> 00:06:30.539
What happened to you?
你怎么了？

00:06:30.622 --> 00:06:32.374
Oh, nothing. Everything's great.
没事，都挺好的

00:06:32.457 --> 00:06:34.876
Fabulous. Zippity-dippity.
特棒，好得不要不要的

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.546
Okay, let me guess. She dumped you.
好吧，我猜猜，她把你给踹了

00:06:37.629 --> 00:06:39.715
What is wrong with me?
我做错什么了？

00:06:40.298 --> 00:06:42.509
Everybody has somebody.
每个人都有爱人

00:06:42.592 --> 00:06:45.220
And all I've got is my boyish good looks
我只有年轻英俊的脸庞
还有这个墨西哥乐队

00:06:45.303 --> 00:06:47.222
and this mariachi band.
我只有年轻英俊的脸庞
还有这个墨西哥乐队

00:06:47.305 --> 00:06:49.266
-(all whooping)
-(mariachi music playing)

00:06:49.725 --> 00:06:50.726
(sobbing)

00:06:51.393 --> 00:06:52.644
(blows nose)

00:06:52.728 --> 00:06:54.146
Oh! So itchy!
好痒啊！

00:06:54.521 --> 00:06:56.356
Come on. Let's get you cleaned up.
走吧，我给你洗洗去

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:57.441
Ahh!

00:07:06.283 --> 00:07:08.285
(muffled struggling)

00:07:17.043 --> 00:07:18.044
(banging)

00:07:21.923 --> 00:07:22.924
(grunting)

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:29.431
(sighs)

00:07:32.601 --> 00:07:33.602
(exclaims)

00:07:40.358 --> 00:07:41.359
Whoa!

00:07:44.988 --> 00:07:46.698
-(screams)
-(alarm blaring)

00:07:54.206 --> 00:07:55.207
(grunting)

00:08:03.799 --> 00:08:04.800
(exclaims)

